{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50822","headline":"宣州开元寺赠惟直上人 · 许浑","name":"宣州开元寺赠惟直上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾与径山爲小师，十年僧行衆人知。\n夜深月色当禅处，斋後钟声到讲时。\n经雨绿苔侵古画，过秋红叶落新诗。\n劝君莫厌江城客，虽在风尘别有期。\n（见丹徒陈庆年刊《横山草堂丛书》本《许浑诗真蹟录》。\n）（《全唐诗》卷五二六误作杜牧诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}